> My advice, personalized for you given your self-declaration as a
> "novice" and current equipment would be:
> 2 blessed scrolls of charging,
> blessed greased +2 Silver Dragon Scale Mail
> 2 blessed tins of green dragon meat (if you don't already have poison
> resistance)
> blessed spellbook of identify
>
> You'll have at least 1 wish remaining, so then go to Sokoban and if
> there is no bag of holding, wish for a:
> blessed greased bag of holding
>
> otherwise you'll have at least 1 wish remaining.  Amulet of Life
> Saving is not a bad idea.  Wand of polymorph or magic marker are good
> ones.
>
> Don't use a wish on a weapon, your best one is Magicbane and that
> comes free courtesy of an altar. "Nethack artifact" in your favorite
> search engine for more information.
> Don't waste wishes on helms and gloves, you'll be able to cast spells
> just fine without a helm of brilliance, but you might need to ditch
> the gauntlets of power later for leather/dexterity (both the same, dex
> does not matter).  Don't use wishes on rings until you know that you
> need them.
